SCOPE NOTE (read together with the license above)

The MIT license above covers the original contributions of this project:
the four-vehicle cooperative transport plant, event-substep integrator,
connector models, centralized physical MPC, CUDA finite-difference backend,
legal-information interface, three-host task packs, protocols and tooling.

Part of this repository is DERIVED FROM AN UPSTREAM PROJECT:

    https://github.com/Rajpal9/Adaptive-koopman
    R. Singh, C. K. Sah, J. Keshavan, "Adaptive Koopman Embedding for Robust
    Control of Complex Dynamical Systems", arXiv:2405.09101

That upstream repository carries NO license file, so its licensing status is
unspecified by its authors. The MIT grant above therefore does NOT extend to
upstream-derived material, which includes at least:

    core/, models/, dynamics/, saved_models/ (paths only),
    and the tutorial notebooks at the repository root
    (Coupled_pendulum_*, Serial_Manipulators_*, Planar_Quadrotor_*,
     single_vehicle_*, tf3--tf9, test_single_lv*, testlv7z*)

If you are an upstream author and want these files removed or relicensed,
please open an issue and the affected paths will be adjusted.
